Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1476bd80-51c7-3c4f-aa46-981e29fe09f7.xml</text>
